    ">FlashAttention · menos tráfico de memoria</strong>": ">FlashAttention · less memory traffic</strong>",
    ">Usa tiling para no materializar toda la matriz de atención en HBM y reducir lecturas/escrituras. Sigue calculando atención densa exacta.</p>": ">It uses tiling to avoid materializing the full attention matrix in HBM and to reduce reads/writes. It still computes exact dense attention.</p>",
